F0011 exact switching-normalized integral-spectrum enumeration
All arithmetic is signed int64 with proof bound |(M^k)_{ij}| <= n^(k-1) <= 7^6 < 2^63.
A candidate integral spectrum is an ordered multiset of integers in [-n,n], satisfying sum lambda^2=n^2 and the mod-2 parity theorem.

